or reviewers\n3. Check the actual review form template on OpenReview, which would show the specific rating options and their descriptions\n\nI apologize that I couldn't retrieve the complete rating scale information from my search.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6fd64fbd-040e-43dd-8257-d68950227536","uuid":"351ef163-f88a-428f-97f9-ca9a31b7b745","timestamp":"2026-05-23T04:26:37.984Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2024 2025 OpenReview review form rating scale 1-10 overall score","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01XPHjwzJEDi8jBeNphQTBg4","content":[{"title":"CoRL 2024 | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org/CoRL/2024"},{"title":"CoRL 2025 | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org/CoRL/2025"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 Conference | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2024%2FConference"},{"title":"CoRL 2025 Conference | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FConference"},{"title":"Can Small and Reasoning Large Language Models Score Journal Articles for Research Quality and Do Averaging and Few-shot Help?","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.22389"},{"title":"What Drives Paper Acceptance? A Process-Centric Analysis of Modern Peer Review","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2509.25701"},{"title":"Best Reviewers Award for 2024","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC11955497/"},{"title":"OpenReviewer: A Specialized Large Language Model for Generating Critical   Scientific Paper Reviews","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2412.11948"}]},"The search results show OpenReview pages for CoRL 2024 and 2025, but don't provide detailed information about the review form rating scale. Let me search more specifically for the review instructions or call for papers documentation.",{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01PJ65cHfBYJBrhFFdg