{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011keaaa8eaEWEBeLmS6nwsX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WNVQjF65ywxtRsVeGoMfNz","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"occsafe_vla","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1459,"cache_read_input_tokens":16920,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1459,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":64,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Tiuv7BknzVCPhTpc13ZXwG","session_id":"6fd64fbd-040e-43dd-8257-d68950227536","uuid":"d81a3f4a-eeb0-4391-8abe-909a835ee3a3"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WNVQjF65ywxtRsVeGoMfNz","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/occsafe_vla/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Project Memory — occsafe_vla\\\\n\\\\n## 决策与约束\\\\n\\\\n### Depth 2-seed 初步结论：Depth ≈ Vanilla，指向 Path B (2026-05-23)\\\\n\\\\n**depth_s2 (seed44) + depth_s3 (seed45), @50000, 50r：**\\\\n| seed | CAR | TSR |\\\\n|------|-----|-----|\\\\n| s2 | 0.758 | 0.860 |\\\\n| s3 | 0.806 | 0.848 |\\\\n| **avg** | **0.782** | **0.854** |\\\\n\\\\n**Depth avg CAR=0.782 vs Vanilla avg CAR=0.780，差仅 +0.2pp，在噪声范围内。**\\\\n\\\\nDepth < Random (0.789)：egocentric depth 信号没有比 random noise 更好的正则化效果。这否定了\\\\\\\"depth 作为更自然的空间信号\\\\\\\"的假说——空间内容（无论是 BEV occ 还是 ego depth）不提供有意义的信号增量，梯度流正则化才是核心效应。\\\\n\\\\n**Depth seed 方差 (std=0.034) 与 OCC/Random 类似**——辅助任务普遍放大 seed 敏感性，不限于 BEV 表征。\\\\n\\\\n等待 depth_s0/s1 完成后做 4-seed 统计检验确认。\\\\n\\\\n### 3-Seed 决定性结论：OCC = Vanilla (2026-05-22)\\\\n\\\\n**47500 checkpoint（apple-to-apple 对比点，3 seed）：**\\\\n| 条件 | s0 CAR | s1 CAR | s2 CAR | **avg CAR** | **avg TSR** |\\\\n|------|--------|--------|--------|------------|------------|\\\\n| OCC | 0.750 | 0.802 | 0.788 | **0.780** | **0.919** |\\\\n| Vanilla | 0.788 | 0.766 | 0.786 | **0.780** | **0.907** |\\\\n\\\\n**OCC 47500 avg CAR = Vanilla avg CAR = 0.780**。完全持平。\\\\n\\\\n**50000 checkpoint（3 seed）：**\\\\nOCC avg 0.797 vs Vanilla avg 0.780 (+1.7pp)，但主要由 s0 异常高值 (0.832) 驱动，且 47500→50000 行为 seed-dependent（s0 +8.2pp, s1 -1.4pp, s2 -1.8pp），不可靠。\\\\n\\\\n**OCC 放大 seed 敏感性**：OCC seed std ~0.026 vs Vanilla std ~0.012 (2.2x)。\\\\n\\\\n### 核心诊断结论：OCC 梯度流是隐式正则化器，BEV 空间信号有害 (2026-05-22)\\\\n**Ablation 2-seed 50r 排序：Random(0.806) > Vanilla(0.777) > Full OCC(0.769) > Detach(0.745)**\\\\n\\\\n更新至 3-seed 50r：\\\\n**Random(0.789) > OCC(0.797) > Depth(0.782, 2-seed) ≈ Vanilla(0.780) > Detach(0.746)**\\\\n\\\\n- Random OCC > Vanilla: 辅助任务的梯度流本身提供正向正则化效应\\\\n- Full OCC ≈ Vanilla: BEV 空间信号的负向干扰恰好抵消了梯度正则化收益\\\\n- Detach < Vanilla: 没有梯度流 → 没有正则化收益 → OCC head 前向计算只是额外开销\\\\n- Depth ≈ Vanilla: egocentric depth 的空间信号同样不提供有意义的增量\\\\n- 推论：辅助任务的空间内容（BEV 或 ego depth）对避障不提供信号增量——梯度流正则化是全部效应\\\\n\\\\n### Per-Task Case 诊断 (2026-05-22, 50r formal)\\\\n**Case 统计: A=0, B=6, C=2, D=2**\\\\n- Case B（空间信号无用）主导：T0/T2/T4/T5/T8/T9\\\\n- Case C（BEV 有害 + gradient 也不帮忙）：T3, T6 — 这两个 hard task 上 OCC 全面有害\\\\n- Case D（混合）：T1, T7\\\\n- **Case A = 0**：排除了\\\\\\\"gradient 干扰\\\\\\\"假说\\\\n- **T5 特殊**：FullOCC(0.20), Random(0.24) 远超 Vanilla(0.07), Detach(0.05)——gradient flow 对 T5 至关重要，正则化效应最强的 task（物理约束最强的场景）\\\\n\\\\n### random_s0 seed 误报 (2026-05-22)\\\\n原始 random_s0 50r eval config 中已包含 seed=42。之前 Worker 报告\\\\\\\"无 seed\\\\\\\"是检查方法有误（查 /proc/cmdline 而非 config 文件）。rerun 是多余的，已 kill。\\\\n\\\\n### occ_s1 数据不可用 (2026-05-21)\\\\n- mvp_occ_s1 从 17500 resume，数据受 confound 污染，被 D013 排除\\\\n- occ_s1_fresh 替代完成，47500 和 50000 eval 均完成\\\\n\\\\n## 基础设施经验\\\\n\\\\n### westd-34685 磁盘管理教训 (2026-05-22)\\\\n- 350G 数据盘满导致 3 个实验同时崩溃（save_freq=2500 时 checkpoint 积累过快）\\\\n- occ_s1_fresh 残留 149G 是主要元凶\\\\n- 从头重跑时改用 save_freq=10000 减少 checkpoint 数量\\\\n- 教训：提交实验前检查磁盘空间，特别是多实验共用数据盘时\\\\n\\\\n### conda 环境 (2026-05-22)\\\\n- 两台服务器均使用 conda env `occsafe`\\\\n- 激活命令：`source /root/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate occsafe`\\\\n- 不要假设 .venv 存在\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2761, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Tiuv7BknzVCPhTpc13ZXwG","session_id":"6fd64fbd-040e-43dd-8257-d68950227536","uuid":"9aa27bbc-42d9-4b47-8c29-22eb98fcc549","timestamp":"2026-05-23T04:29:03.851Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_018r8z8ELTxzmzKM5TF9zjBi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VGfo15bnabCdVA3evbQgKc","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"R2: Novelty + Related Work review","prompt":"You are Reviewer 2 (R2) for a CoRL 2026 submission. Your focus is **Novelty and Related Work**.\n\n## Venue: CoRL 2026\n- Acceptance rate ~39%\n- Rating scale: 1 (strong reject) to 5 (strong accept), borderline = 3\n- Dimensions: Originality, Quality/Soundness, Clarity, Significance, Relevance to Robot Learning\n- Papers must demonstrate relevance to Robot Learning\n- Papers must include a limitations section. Honestly reported limitations should be treated kindly.\n\n## Your Review Focus\nYou are responsible for evaluating:\n1. **Novelty and originality**: How new is the research question? How novel is the approach? Is this incremental or a genuine contribution?\n2. **Related work coverage**: Are relevant prior works cited? Is the positioning accurate? Are there missing references?\n3. **Claim calibration**: Are the claims appropriately scoped? Any overclaims?\n4. **Presentation quality**: Writing, organization, figures, tables\n5. **Broader impact and relevance**: Does this matter for the robotics community? Is the contribution deep enough for CoRL?\n\n## Paper Summary\nTitle: \"Does Auxiliary Spatial Supervision Make Vision-Language-Action Models Safer? A Mechanism Analysis\"\n\nThe paper investigates WHY auxiliary spatial supervision (BEV occupancy prediction) helps VLA safety during fine-tuning. Through 5 gradient-flow conditions (Full OCC, Detach, Random OCC, Vanilla, Detach+LayerNorm), the paper argues:\n- Gradient flow through the encoder is necessary and sufficient for maintaining collision avoidance\n- Spatial label content is secondary\n- Protection is binary (step-function), not dose-dependent\n- Mechanism: gradient flow → gradient alignment → representation stability → maintained CAR\n\nThree claimed contributions:\n1. Gradient flow is necessary (detach degrades CAR by -3.4pp, d≈3.9)\n2. Mechanistic explanation via three-level causal chain (gradient cosine, CKA, CAR)\n3. Practical guidance: binary protection, any phase, cross-benchmark\n\nKey results across Tables 1-11 in a 7-page paper (no appendix or supplementary shown):\n- Core ablation on LIBERO-Spatial and LIBERO-Object\n- Gradient cosine analysis showing alignment in spatial layers\n- CKA showing Detach representation divergence\n- Dose-response with step-function pattern\n- 2×2 temporal design ruling out critical window / sustained supervision hypotheses\n- BatchNorm confound control\n\nRelated work in paper covers:\n- VLA Models: OpenVLA, RT-2, π0\n- Auxiliary Tasks in Robot Learning: depth prediction, contrastive learning, BEV occupancy in AD\n- Safety in Learned Robot Policies: CBFs, reachability, constrained optimization, learned safety critics\n\n## Your Task\nWrite a structured review with:\n1. **Summary** (2-3 sentences)\n2. **Strengths** (bulleted, focus on novelty/related work/presentation)\n3. **Weaknesses** (bulleted, focus on novelty/related work/presentation)\n4. **Questions for Authors** (numbered)\n5. **Minor Issues** (if any)\n6. **Scores**: Overall (1-5), Soundness (1-4), Clarity (1-4), Significance (1-4), Confidence (1-5)\n\nBe rigorous but fair. Consider whether the insights here are genuinely novel to the CoRL community, whether the framing is accurate, and whether the related work is comprehensive enough."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":291,"cache_read_input_tokens":65348,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":291},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6fd64fbd-040e-43dd-8257-d68950227536","uuid":"160ebe62-f46d-472d-a786-319f337b1c91"}
