{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SEB9wprrpNVYjVZjgckpHU","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/occsafe_vla/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-23\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 服务器 | GPU | 预计完成 |\\\\n|--------|--------|-----|---------|\\\\n| vanilla_retrain_s0 | westd-34685 | cuda:0 | ~16:48 UTC |\\\\n| full_occ_retrain_s0 | westd-34685 | cuda:1 | ~16:48 UTC |\\\\n| cutoff_s2 | westd-10894 | cuda:0 | ~07:30 UTC |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- gradient_analysis: 部分完成（Detach s2 + Random OCC s2 已跑），等 retrain 完成后跑 Vanilla + Full OCC\\\\n- cka_analysis: 脚本已就绪，等 retrain 完成后跑完整跨条件 CKA 对比\\\\n\\\\n## 梯度分析结果（已完成部分）\\\\n\\\\n### westd-34685 (Full OCC + Depth)\\\\n- Action/OCC 梯度余弦: -0.013 ~ +0.018（正交）\\\\n- Depth 辅助梯度 10-20x > OCC，方向相同\\\\n- SigLIP 晚期层冲突率 50%→19%\\\\n- CKA: Full OCC vs Depth diagonal = 0.108\\\\n\\\\n### westd-10894 (Detach s2 + Random OCC s2)\\\\n- **OCC 梯度流将 action 梯度放大 8-69 倍**（vs Detach）\\\\n- Detach action_loss=0.434 vs Random OCC=0.236\\\\n- Action/OCC 余弦: -0.006 ~ +0.027（正交）\\\\n- 冲突率 42-57%（~随机 50%）\\\\n- artifact: gradient_analysis_results (art_20260523_70512d)\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **cutoff_s1_eval** (success): CAR=0.798, TSR=0.918\\\\n- **cutoff_s0_eval** (success): 50r SafeLIBERO eval\\\\n- **depth_s1_eval** (success): 50r SafeLIBERO eval\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 23 / 负向 3 / 失败 0 / 共 26\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n1. retrain 完成 → 完整 4 条件梯度 + CKA → 论文 Figure/Table\\\\n2. cutoff_s2 完成 → eval → Cutoff 3-seed\\\\n3. checkpoint 备份\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-34685: cuda:0 vanilla_retrain, cuda:1 full_occ_retrain, cuda:2 空闲, cuda:3 空闲\\\\nwestd-10894: cuda:0 cutoff_s2, cuda:1 空闲\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1353, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01VGfo15